cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DiffPred"
abstract: >-
  DiffPred is a research codebase for diffusion-based molecular property
  prediction, accompanying the manuscript titled "Improving Molecular Property Prediction with Score-based Diffusion Models". Experiments are configured with Hydra and
  orchestrated as DVC pipelines for reproducibility.
authors:
  - family-names: Horwood
    given-names: Julien
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-15
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jdhorwood/diffpred"
keywords:
  - diffusion models
  - molecular property prediction
  - drug discovery
  - machine learning
  - uncertainty quantification
